State functional correctness in the contracts.

Adds an `#[ensures]` to each of the thirteen public SHA-3 and SHAKE functions,
comparing its output to the FIPS 202 transcript `pedantic-sha3`, the
`digest_matches` helper `hash`'s contract uses, and the dependency on the
transcript. Upstream's own `#[requires]` clauses are left as they are.

